          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka ŋikanikaarei ŋirwa ke elap ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikaarei, elap ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, eriŋa Yeoiakim erwosit a Yudaya erae emabus alo Babiblon, kisyak Ebilimerodak ŋolo alo Babilon akipuka Babilon, tolacak Ebilimerodak Yeoiakim erwosit a Yudaya alomabus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes torimaaniar aneni a Yeoiakim, kitopoloo iŋes adepar ŋirwosi ŋuluce ŋulu epukatotor iŋes alo Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun abu Yeoiakim tolaca tari ŋilowi keŋ ŋulu sek alomabus ka abu toruwor ŋolo emujenene alokai ke erwosit jwi jwi anakiyar keŋ a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit inanak Yeoiakim ŋisiliŋa ŋidi a ŋinakoloŋit ikotere iŋarakinor ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyo iŋes alo Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
